  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 是一個函式庫模組，為許多 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">@heyitsfuzs</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的 Minecraft 模組所必需。它本身不會新增方塊、物品、生物或遊戲玩法，而是提供這些模組正常運行所需的共享系統。🧩</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">對玩家而言，這意味著更簡單的安裝流程，以及支援的模組之間更一致的行為。如果其他模組將此模組列為必要，請將其與該模組一同安裝，並保持啟用。✅</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組主要是為 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">@heyitsfuzs</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自己的專案所建構，並非設計為其他模組開發者的通用函式庫。其重點在於讓這些模組保持可靠、易於維護，並能在支援的模組載入器上使用。🔧</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必要函式庫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提供許多 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">@heyitsfuzs</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組所需的共享基礎。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多載入器支援：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">協助支援的模組在 Fabric 和 NeoForge 上保持一致運作。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">共享模組系統：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">支援依賴模組使用的常見功能，例如設定、網路、事件和註冊支援。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">輕量基礎：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在背景運行，不會增加遊戲內容或造成世界混亂。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提升模組包可靠性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">減少模組間的重複系統，幫助依賴模組表現得更一致。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌐 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用戶端與伺服器端支援：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">適用於單人、多人以及專用伺服器環境。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需額外安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需額外安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bag-of-holding\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tiny-skeletons\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
